  "bodyHash": "b94e61ad581110de",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>Fallen Fungus 🍄&zwj;🟫</h1>\n<p><strong>此模組</strong>&nbsp;為《Minecraft》加入了<strong>倒伏真菌</strong>，並分佈於<strong>所有擁有真菌與蘑菇的生物群系中</strong>，為<strong>原版遊戲</strong>增添了更豐富的氛圍 ⛰️</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e41c61d8aa38e86e2d3ec48e0147b5956a94c2dd_0.webp\" alt=\"倒伏真菌\"></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>LuisterCorp &copy; - 2025</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>備註📝（Notes）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fallen Fungus</strong>&nbsp;已<strong>提供英文等多種語言翻譯📇</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Fallen Fungus</strong>&nbsp;與<strong>1.20 至 1.21.11</strong>版本<strong>完全相容</strong>🏷️</li>\n<li><strong>Fallen Fungus</strong>&nbsp;為世界生成新增了真菌與蘑菇<strong>（結構體）</strong>🌐</li>\n<li><strong>Fallen Fungus</strong>&nbsp;與世界中的任何<strong>生成類資料包</strong>均相容</li>\n<li><strong>不需要</strong>解壓縮已下載的檔案 🗂️</li>\n<li>建議<strong>使用耳機</strong>以獲得<strong>更佳體驗</strong> 🎧</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>介紹 🎼（Description）</h2>\n<p>在《Minecraft》原版遊戲中享受更具沉浸感的體驗，<strong>我們新增了 4 種以上的倒伏真菌&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3edc6f86c54c3da3d276f83eba0830ba0938cbf9.png\" alt=\"深紅真菌物品\">，並包含多種變體</strong>，為主世界與下界<strong>每個生物群系帶來獨特且多樣的特色</strong>🌎。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/096af63f0f870a4dbd2f69a8fbb2e8a0c7e0a351.png\" alt=\"倒伏真菌宣傳圖\"></p>\n<p>搭配此<strong>資料包</strong>，探索變得更加精彩，自然生成的倒伏真菌將出現在<strong>不同的生物群系中，包括蘑菇島、黑暗森林、扭曲森林與深紅森林🧭</strong></p>\n<h2>生成機制🌐（Generation）</h2>\n<p><strong>每個生物群系</strong>&nbsp;都有獨特的真菌與蘑菇生成規則，不同群系之間會有所差異，以下為各生物群系及其對應<strong>倒伏真菌的範例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>扭曲森林 - 倒伏真菌</p>\n<h2>倒伏真菌變體數量：8</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab2bfce639e69ecb9ebab65ac078af136c0dd78f.png\" alt=\"扭曲真菌樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c074699d1d59913faf463ea099bf58d645fdcf6e.png\" alt=\"扭曲倒伏真菌\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab2bfce639e69ecb9ebab65ac078af136c0dd78f.png\" alt=\"扭曲真菌樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:warped_forest\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>深紅森林 - 倒伏真菌</p>\n<h2>倒伏真菌變體數量：8</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3edc6f86c54c3da3d276f83eba0830ba0938cbf9.png\" alt=\"深紅真菌樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/352291537d91dfcccb6817efa4f5240eb2c239a1.png\" alt=\"深紅倒伏真菌\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3edc6f86c54c3da3d276f83eba0830ba0938cbf9.png\" alt=\"深紅真菌樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:crimson_forest\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>黑暗森林 - 倒伏蘑菇</p>\n<h2>倒伏蘑菇變體數量：4</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db7cd1020ed8f6ab949346acf099e8d8827d9303.png\" alt=\"紅色蘑菇\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/df913da16343e6d68f653fab7f4b6087608a611f.png\" alt=\"深色橡木蘑菇\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"深色橡樹樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:dark_forest\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>蘑菇島 - 倒伏蘑菇</p>\n<h2>倒伏蘑菇變體數量：6</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8100ab22a7e7bdc543e2d3b239725ff5762d6814.png\" alt=\"棕色蘑菇\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/657af52ce4f32bcc151d91829b66e95f5cb9086d.png\" alt=\"棕色倒伏蘑菇\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db7cd1020ed8f6ab949346acf099e8d8827d9303.png\" alt=\"紅色蘑菇\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:mushroom_fields\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>更多結構體</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>下界熔岩井</p>\n<h2>熔岩井變體數量：2</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3edc6f86c54c3da3d276f83eba0830ba0938cbf9.png\" alt=\"深紅真菌樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cf778b597d998f9ea813579c936bd38f55a3eb57.jpeg\" alt=\"熔岩井宣傳圖\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e84483560f03bc7a73932ba1c750040050d7e434.png\" alt=\"橡樹樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:crimson_forest\"\n\n\"minecraft:warped_forest\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>真菌水井</p>\n<h2>水井變體數量：2</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db7cd1020ed8f6ab949346acf099e8d8827d9303.png\" alt=\"紅色蘑菇\">&nbsp;<strong>宣傳圖片：</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7ec193023141c96fff5e43df1c11e921ae042a26.jpeg\" alt=\"真菌水井宣傳圖\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/797d3d93c3f9dad7091a1e74d8c82bf5d0540de5.png\" alt=\"深色橡木樹苗\">&nbsp;<strong>生物群系生成列表：</strong></p>\n<pre><code>[\n\n\"minecraft:dark_forest\"\n\n\"minecraft:mushroom_fields\"\n\n],</code></pre>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>新成就 🏆（New Advancements）</h2>\n<p>在主世界中蒐集所有<strong>倒伏蘑菇</strong>的變體，即可解鎖隱藏進度<strong>「我們的公主在另一個蘑菇裡！」</strong>；在下界蒐集所有<strong>倒伏真菌</strong>的變體，則可解鎖隱藏成就<strong>「豬布林伐木工」</strong>。顯示效果如下：</p>\n<p>◾&nbsp;<strong>圖片 (Images)&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d7ebd968518f7bf67ccd1b4a5145837cdb0a39db.png\" alt=\"鐵斧頭物品\">:</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b1e662db4103fa328a15c5adadd673d348dee964.png\" alt=\"倒伏蘑菇成就\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/06f3194f27642f38130a55231a453b8728d29469.png\" alt=\"倒伏真菌成就\"></p>",
